{
  "info": {
    "name": "ZYNOTRIX API",
    "description": "Complete Postman collection for the ZYNOTRIX Task Management API.\n\nSetup:\n1. Set the `baseUrl` variable to your server URL (default: http://localhost:3000)\n2. Log in via the 'Register' or use an existing account\n3. Authenticate by visiting the app in a browser — cookies will be shared if using Postman's cookie jar\n\nNote: All authenticated endpoints require the NextAuth session cookie.",
